diagnostic_auto.py
==================
Fully automatic diagnostic — no keyboard required.
Walk through each scenario during the countdown, the script
captures samples automatically, evaluates, and writes a report.

Usage:
    PYTHONPATH=build/python python3 diagnostic_auto.py

Workflow per scenario:
    1. Big instruction shown on screen + spoken via terminal bell
    2. PREPARE countdown  (you walk to position)
    3. CAPTURE phase      (auto-captures 5 samples silently)
    4. Results shown briefly, move to next scenario

Total time: ~5 minutes for all 8 scenarios.
"""

